{"html":"<blockquote>\n<p>适用于树莓派RJ45口连接网线，使用树莓派自带的无线网卡开启AP的情况</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"heading-0\" data-id=\"heading-0\">前置</h2>\n<p>用网线连接树莓派的RJ45网口，可以使用DHCP自动分配的IP或者设置静态IP</p>\n<h2 id=\"heading-1\" data-id=\"heading-1\">系统配置</h2>\n<h3 id=\"heading-2\" data-id=\"heading-2\">设置IP转发</h3>\n<p>因为Linux系统默认关闭了IP转发，所以要手动开启，编辑<code>/etc/sysctl.conf</code>，取消下列行的注释：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-ini\"><code class=\"hljs language-ini\" data-raw=\"net.ipv4.ip_forward%3D1\"><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"1\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">net.ipv4.ip_forward</span>=<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span></span>\n          </div></code>\n</code></pre><p>然后应用配置：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\" data-raw=\"sudo%20sysctl%20-p\"><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"1\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-built_in\">sudo</span> sysctl -p</span>\n          </div></code>\n</code></pre><h3 id=\"heading-3\" data-id=\"heading-3\">设置有线接口的NAT</h3>\n<p>如果连接网线的接口为<code>eth0</code>，设置</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\" data-raw=\"sudo%20iptables%20-t%20nat%20-A%20POSTROUTING%20-o%20eth0%20-j%20MASQUERADE%0Asudo%20iptables%20-A%20FORWARD%20-i%20wlan0%20-o%20eth0%20-j%20ACCEPT%0Asudo%20iptables%20-A%20FORWARD%20-i%20eth0%20-o%20wlan0%20-m%20state%20--state%20RELATED%2CESTABLISHED%20-j%20ACCEPT\"><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"1\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-built_in\">sudo</span> iptables -t nat -A POSTROUTING -o eth0 -j MASQUERADE</span>\n          </div><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"2\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-built_in\">sudo</span> iptables -A FORWARD -i wlan0 -o eth0 -j ACCEPT</span>\n          </div><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"3\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-built_in\">sudo</span> iptables -A FORWARD -i eth0 -o wlan0 -m state --state RELATED,ESTABLISHED -j ACCEPT</span>\n          </div></code>\n</code></pre><p><em>如果提示找不到命令iptables，先执行<code>sudo apt install iptables</code></em></p>\n<p>设置后，每次树莓派重启就会重置NAT配置，因此需要持久化设置，通过安装<code>iptables-persistent</code>来保存规则：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\" data-raw=\"sudo%20apt%20install%20iptables-persistent%0Asudo%20netfilter-persistent%20save\"><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"1\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-built_in\">sudo</span> apt install iptables-persistent</span>\n          </div><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"2\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-built_in\">sudo</span> netfilter-persistent save</span>\n          </div></code>\n</code></pre><p>之后再次重启<code>dnsmasq</code>：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\" data-raw=\"sudo%20systemctl%20restart%20dnsmasq\"><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"1\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-built_in\">sudo</span> systemctl restart dnsmasq</span>\n          </div></code>\n</code></pre><h3 id=\"heading-4\" data-id=\"heading-4\">网络配置</h3>\n<p>如果树莓派使用的网络管理工具是<code>systemd-networkd</code>，先查看其状态</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\" data-raw=\"sudo%20systemctl%20status%20systemd-networkd\"><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"1\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-built_in\">sudo</span> systemctl status systemd-networkd</span>\n          </div></code>\n</code></pre><p>如果服务没有运行，先启动：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\" data-raw=\"sudo%20systemctl%20enable%20systemd-networkd%0Asudo%20systemctl%20start%20systemd-networkd\"><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"1\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-built_in\">sudo</span> systemctl <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">enable</span> systemd-networkd</span>\n          </div><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"2\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-built_in\">sudo</span> systemctl start systemd-networkd</span>\n          </div></code>\n</code></pre><p>再给无线网卡<code>wlan0</code>创建一个配置文件<code>/etc/systemd/network/wlan0.network</code>：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-ini\"><code class=\"hljs language-ini\" data-raw=\"%5BMatch%5D%0AName%3Dwlan0%0A%0A%5BNetwork%5D%0AAddress%3D192.168.10.1%2F24%0ADHCPServer%3Dyes%0A%0A%5BDHCPServer%5D%0APoolOffset%3D100%0APoolSize%3D100%0AEmitDNS%3Dyes%0ADNS%3D8.8.8.8%208.8.4.4\"><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"1\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-section\">[Match]</span></span>\n          </div><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"2\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">Name</span>=wlan0</span>\n          </div><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"3\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\">&nbsp;</span>\n          </div><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"4\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-section\">[Network]</span></span>\n          </div><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"5\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">Address</span>=<span class=\"hljs-number\">192.168</span>.<span class=\"hljs-number\">10.1</span>/<span class=\"hljs-number\">24</span></span>\n          </div><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"6\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">DHCPServer</span>=<span class=\"hljs-literal\">yes</span></span>\n          </div><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"7\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\">&nbsp;</span>\n          </div><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"8\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-section\">[DHCPServer]</span></span>\n          </div><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"9\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">PoolOffset</span>=<span class=\"hljs-number\">100</span></span>\n          </div><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"10\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">PoolSize</span>=<span class=\"hljs-number\">100</span></span>\n          </div><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"11\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">EmitDNS</span>=<span class=\"hljs-literal\">yes</span></span>\n          </div><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"12\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">DNS</span>=<span class=\"hljs-number\">8.8</span>.<span class=\"hljs-number\">8.8</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">8.8</span>.<span class=\"hljs-number\">4.4</span></span>\n          </div></code>\n</code></pre><ul>\n<li><code>Address=192.168.10.1/24</code>设置<code>wlan0</code>的IP地址，和下面<code>dnsmasq</code>配置保持一致</li>\n<li><code>PoolOffset=100</code>和<code>PoolSize=100</code>，设置DHCP池的IP偏移量，并设置池大小，所以DHCP的IP池范围为<code>192.168.10.100</code>到<code>192.168.10.200</code>，和下面<code>dnsmasq</code>配置保持一致</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"heading-5\" data-id=\"heading-5\">配置dnsmasq</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>似乎可以不用配置（未测试）</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"heading-6\" data-id=\"heading-6\">安装<code>dnsmasq</code></h3>\n<p>安装dnsmasq创建DHCP池实现连接热点自动分配ip</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\" data-raw=\"sudo%20apt%20install%20dnsmasq\"><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"1\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-built_in\">sudo</span> apt install dnsmasq</span>\n          </div></code>\n</code></pre><h3 id=\"heading-7\" data-id=\"heading-7\">配置</h3>\n<p>创建<code>/etc/dnsmasq.conf</code>，写入配置：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-ini\"><code class=\"hljs language-ini\" data-raw=\"interface%3Dwlan0%0Adhcp-range%3D192.168.10.100%2C192.168.10.200%2C255.255.255.0%2C24h\"><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"1\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">interface</span>=wlan0</span>\n          </div><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"2\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">dhcp-range</span>=<span class=\"hljs-number\">192.168</span>.<span class=\"hljs-number\">10.100</span>,<span class=\"hljs-number\">192.168</span>.<span class=\"hljs-number\">10.200</span>,<span class=\"hljs-number\">255.255</span>.<span class=\"hljs-number\">255.0</span>,<span class=\"hljs-number\">24</span>h</span>\n          </div></code>\n</code></pre><p><code>dhcp-range</code>可以自定义为自己想要的ip段</p>\n<p>之后重启<code>dnsmasq</code>服务：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\" data-raw=\"sudo%20systemctl%20restart%20dnsmasq\"><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"1\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-built_in\">sudo</span> systemctl restart dnsmasq</span>\n          </div></code>\n</code></pre><h2 id=\"heading-8\" data-id=\"heading-8\">配置hostapd</h2>\n<p>安装hostapd用于给无线网卡设置为AP模式</p>\n<h3 id=\"heading-9\" data-id=\"heading-9\">安装<code>hostapd</code></h3>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\" data-raw=\"sudo%20apt%20install%20hostapd\"><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"1\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-built_in\">sudo</span> apt install hostapd</span>\n          </div></code>\n</code></pre><h3 id=\"heading-10\" data-id=\"heading-10\">配置</h3>\n<p>创建<code>/etc/hostapd/hostapd.conf</code>，配置为：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-ini\"><code class=\"hljs language-ini\" data-raw=\"interface%3Dwlan0%0Acountry_code%3DUS%0Adriver%3Dnl80211%0Assid%3D%3Cwifiname%3E%0Ahw_mode%3Da%0Achannel%3D149%0Aieee80211n%3D1%0Aieee80211ac%3D1%0Awmm_enabled%3D1%0Aht_capab%3D%5BHT40%2B%5D%5BSHORT-GI-20%5D%0Avht_capab%3D%5BSHORT-GI-80%5D%0Avht_oper_chwidth%3D1%0Avht_oper_centr_freq_seg0_idx%3D155%0Awpa%3D2%0Awpa_passphrase%3D%3Cpassword%3E%0Awpa_key_mgmt%3DWPA-PSK%0Arsn_pairwise%3DCCMP%0A\"><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"1\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">interface</span>=wlan0</span>\n          </div><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"2\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">country_code</span>=US</span>\n          </div><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"3\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">driver</span>=nl80211</span>\n          </div><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"4\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">ssid</span>=&lt;wifiname&gt;</span>\n          </div><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"5\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">hw_mode</span>=a</span>\n          </div><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"6\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">channel</span>=<span class=\"hljs-number\">149</span></span>\n          </div><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"7\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">ieee80211n</span>=<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span></span>\n          </div><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"8\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">ieee80211ac</span>=<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span></span>\n          </div><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"9\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">wmm_enabled</span>=<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span></span>\n          </div><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"10\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">ht_capab</span>=[HT40+][SHORT-GI-<span class=\"hljs-number\">20</span>]</span>\n          </div><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"11\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">vht_capab</span>=[SHORT-GI-<span class=\"hljs-number\">80</span>]</span>\n          </div><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"12\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">vht_oper_chwidth</span>=<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span></span>\n          </div><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"13\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">vht_oper_centr_freq_seg0_idx</span>=<span class=\"hljs-number\">155</span></span>\n          </div><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"14\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">wpa</span>=<span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span></span>\n          </div><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"15\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">wpa_passphrase</span>=&lt;password&gt;</span>\n          </div><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"16\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">wpa_key_mgmt</span>=WPA-PSK</span>\n          </div><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"17\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">rsn_pairwise</span>=CCMP</span>\n          </div><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"18\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\">&nbsp;</span>\n          </div></code>\n</code></pre><p>其中: <code>ssid</code>为热点名称，<code>wpa_passphrase</code>为热点密码，可以自行设置</p>\n<p>使用自定义配置启动hostapd：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\" data-raw=\"sudo%20hostapd%20%2Fetc%2Fhostapd%2Fhostapd.conf\"><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"1\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-built_in\">sudo</span> hostapd /etc/hostapd/hostapd.conf</span>\n          </div></code>\n</code></pre><p>如果报错类似：<code>hostapd failed to request a scan of neighboring bsses ret=-52 (invalid exchange)</code>，可以参考<a href=\"https://github.com/raspberrypi/linux/issues/3768\">Pi unable to use VHT with built in WiFi chip #3768</a>，下载<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1AN7lC_kMJGGg5AJLhSRtlTRgIh9qJlaI/view\">文件</a>，将<code>.clm_blob</code>文件文件复制到<code>/lib/firmware/brcm/</code>目录</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\" data-raw=\"cp%20cyfmac43455-sdio.clm_blob%20%2Flib%2Ffirmware%2Fbrcm%2Fbrcmfmac43455-sdio.clm_blob\"><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"1\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-built_in\">cp</span> cyfmac43455-sdio.clm_blob /lib/firmware/brcm/brcmfmac43455-sdio.clm_blob</span>\n          </div></code>\n</code></pre><p><strong>注意文件名不一致！！！</strong>\n然后重启树莓派，再按之前的命令启动hostapd</p>\n<h2 id=\"heading-11\" data-id=\"heading-11\">总结</h2>\n<p>树莓派由于硬件限制，无线网卡在2.4GHz情况下热点的速率大概只有70Mb/s左右，开启5GHz信号和设置VHT为80MHz的情况下，Windows显示的连接速度为150Mb/s，从连接速度来看翻了一倍，使用<a href=\"https://test.ustc.edu.cn/\">中国科学技术大学测速网站</a>测试下载速度，原通过<code>nmcli</code>使用2.4GHz信号开启的热点下载速度大约为12Mb/s，改用5GHz后能跑到100多Mb/s，效果提升还是很明显。理论上树莓派4B的无线网卡能跑到千兆速度，<del>但实在是优化不来</del>。采用openWrt配置无线热点因为树莓派性能过于鸡肋，内存和CPU经常吃满卡死，只能采用这种折中的办法。<strong>有条件还是得整一个正儿八经的路由器</strong><del><sub>或者Mac mini</sub></del></p>\n<h2 id=\"heading-12\" data-id=\"heading-12\">外部引用参考</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.hncldz.com/?p=541\">[1] 树莓派4B创建5Ghz WiFi热点</a></p>\n","toc":[{"id":"heading-0","level":2,"text":"前置","listNo":"1"},{"id":"heading-1","level":2,"text":"系统配置","listNo":"2"},{"id":"heading-2","level":3,"text":"设置IP转发","listNo":"2.1"},{"id":"heading-3","level":3,"text":"设置有线接口的NAT","listNo":"2.2"},{"id":"heading-4","level":3,"text":"网络配置","listNo":"2.3"},{"id":"heading-5","level":2,"text":"配置dnsmasq","listNo":"3"},{"id":"heading-6","level":3,"text":"安装dnsmasq","listNo":"3.1"},{"id":"heading-7","level":3,"text":"配置","listNo":"3.2"},{"id":"heading-8","level":2,"text":"配置hostapd","listNo":"4"},{"id":"heading-9","level":3,"text":"安装hostapd","listNo":"4.1"},{"id":"heading-10","level":3,"text":"配置","listNo":"4.2"},{"id":"heading-11","level":2,"text":"总结","listNo":"5"},{"id":"heading-12","level":2,"text":"外部引用参考","listNo":"6"}],"characterCount":3094}